}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8MartinAxiom}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}martin\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8MartinAxiom}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CccForcing}_S(\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle)\\to\\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\left((\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa)\\to\\exists G\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing)\\right)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}martin\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8MartinAxiom}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CccForcing}_S(\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle)\\to\\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\left((\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa)\\to\\exists G\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing)\\right)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The filter is formed on the forcin